==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2~4.67 seconds<sup>60f~140f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 34 seconds<sup>1,020f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage, as long as you have collected many of the [[Treasure]]s from [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3. Defeat these Neerdowells with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] with proper meatshielding.

